<title>USA: Electrochemical Acco plant workers strike.</title>
<headline>Electrochemical Acco plant workers strike.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrochemical Industries Ltd said Thursday employees at its Acco plant stopped all production during the night.</p>
<p>&quot;The management is unable to estimate, at this stage, the duration of the dispute,&quot; a statement from the company said.</p>
<p>The statement did not say describe the issues at the heart of the dispute.</p>
<p>The company said it is prepared to continue to supply its main products for the near future.</p>
